Location: "MarkdownRenderer.kt", BlockQuoteView around line 257.

Problem:

The quote accent bar uses a fixed height of 28dp.

This makes its height inconsistent with multi-line quoted content.

Required correction:

Use an appropriate measurement approach such as:

- "IntrinsicSize.Min" on the parent Row.
- "fillMaxHeight()" on the accent bar.

Ensure the accent bar tracks the actual height of the complete text block.

Acceptance criteria:

- Single-line quotes render correctly.
